    {
        "id": 206,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gavial\"]  Oh, are we fighting that? Fun!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gavial",
        "content": "Oh, are we fighting that? Fun!"
    },
    {
        "id": 207,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 208,
        "raw": "[name=\"High Priest\"]  Hello, nice to meet you!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "High Priest",
        "content": "Hello, nice to meet you!"
    },
    {
        "id": 209,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_416_zumama_1#6\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#6"
    },
    {
        "id": 210,
        "raw": "[name=\"Eunectes\"]  ...High Priest, why did you bring the Big Ugly out?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Eunectes",
        "content": "...High Priest, why did you bring the Big Ugly out?"
    },
    {
        "id": 211,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 212,
        "raw": "[name=\"High Priest\"]  Huh? Aren't we going to fight Gavial? Do we not need it? If not, I'll drive it back. I still want to test the engine.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "High Priest",
        "content": "Huh? Aren't we going to fight Gavial? Do we not need it? If not, I'll drive it back. I still want to test the engine."
    },
    {
        "id": 213,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_416_zumama_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1"
    },
    {
        "id": 214,
        "raw": "[name=\"Eunectes\"]  ...We need it, but not now. I still have something to say.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Eunectes",
        "content": "...We need it, but not now. I still have something to say."
    },
    {
        "id": 215,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 216,
        "raw": "[name=\"High Priest\"]  Oh, alright. You have your talk first then. Call me when you want to fight!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "High Priest",
        "content": "Oh, alright. You have your talk first then. Call me when you want to fight!"
    },
    {
        "id": 217,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_416_zumama_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1"
    },
    {
        "id": 218,
        "raw": "[name=\"Eunectes\"]  Sure.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Eunectes",
        "content": "Sure."
    },
    {
        "id": 219,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1#3\", name2=\"char_416_zumama_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 220,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gavial\"]  Hey, what was that about an engine?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gavial",
        "content": "Hey, what was that about an engine?"
    },
    {
        "id": 221,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1#3\", name2=\"char_416_zumama_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 222,
        "raw": "[name=\"Eunectes\"]  That's right, your engine is powering the Big Ugly right now. If you want it, you'll have to fight for it.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Eunectes",
        "content": "That's right, your engine is powering the Big Ugly right now. If you want it, you'll have to fight for it."
    },
    {
        "id": 223,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1#5\", name2=\"char_416_zumama_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#5",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 224,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gavial\"]  Hehe. Deal!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gavial",
        "content": "Hehe. Deal!"
    },
    {
        "id": 225,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_416_zumama_1#2\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#2"
    },
    {
        "id": 226,
        "raw": "[name=\"Eunectes\"]  Come with me. We'll see who comes out on top.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Eunectes",
        "content": "Come with me. We'll see who comes out on top."
